        "verdict": "proven",
        "note": "The eleven logical caps are replay-stable: two observations with the same count decide alike whatever the host measured, because the decision is a function of the count and of nothing else. Stated over the same observation type as the pump_wcet_ns decision so the two theorems say which field each reads; a definition that read elapsedNs would fail it."
      },
