        "tag": "derives",
        "role": "theorem",
        "verdict": "partial",
        "note": "Proves the MECHANISM is sound -- a fuel-bounded run of the engine model (Rete/FireLoop.idr's iret_11_4__run) fires at most `fuel` times, so the max_fires_per_pump row of this table cannot be outrun by the loop it caps. It does NOT establish that any implementation enforces the cap, which is what this clause asserts. Sound and unused is a different failure from wrong, and the verdict says which."
      }
